scn 1
# Pinwheel gap (legion_world_test `pinwheel`, gap 6): the U-turn's wall with a
# second wall above it (x 98-101, z 0-41), leaving a 6-cell gap (z 42-47) that
# holds three 2-cell files. 48 footprint-2 bodies west of the wall are sent to
# a point beyond it; the files must fold into the gap and take it no slower
# than single file. gate.top.files_x100 is the files abreast in the gap strip
# and side.east.t90 the source's rounded90 (90% at x >= 104).
# Speed 1.79999 builds the source's raw 117964 (see uturn.scn).
# Source numbers (main, offset 0): rounded90 1930, done 3346, files 1.15,
# spread 0.47.
name gap6
ticks 6000
seed 7
map flat 200 140
wall 98 48 4 92
wall 98 0 4 42
type m mover 2 2500 10 1.79999
group A 0 m 48 rect 40 96 64 114 pitch=3
gate top 101 0 101 47
line east 104 0 104 140
at 1 move A 150 110
